{"id":"n91864-1-7","stage":4,"title":"어둑어둑하다 · 昏暗","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91864-1-7-1","ko":"오랜만에 친구들과 술을 한잔하고 올게요.","zh":"好久没见了，我要和朋友们喝点酒，然后回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오랜만에","audio":"/audio/cf175d7879a1bf3c7749.mp3"}},{"text":"친구들과","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구들과","audio":"/audio/5b2aa022738dba43cb55.mp3"}},{"text":"술을","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"술을","audio":"/audio/8bbc7232261087ddd88e.mp3"}},{"text":"한잔하고","meaning":"喝一杯","explanation":"한잔하다：喝一杯；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"한잔하다","audio":"/audio/0daf602b903f50885a5b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62372","senseId":"1","lemma":"한잔하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한잔하고","audio":"/audio/13c6cc6eb9818ac00000.mp3"}},{"text":"올게요.","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올게요","audio":"/audio/65fee9486bc51beeb1c3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3","entryId":"65157","definition":"像啤酒或烧酒等那样含有酒精成分、喝后会醉的饮料。","pronunciation":["술"]},{"id":"0daf602b903f5088","term":"한잔하다","zh":"喝一杯","audio":"/audio/0daf602b903f50885a5b.mp3","entryId":"62372","definition":"稍微喝一场茶、酒等。","pronunciation":["한잔하다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1c8c2678f2e7931588b5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91864-1-7-2","ko":"날이 어둑어둑하니 밤길 조심하렴.","zh":"天色渐渐暗下来了，晚上走路要小心点。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"날이","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날：天气；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62254","senseId":"3","lemma":"날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날이","audio":"/audio/fecb7256d8859fcee381.mp3"}},{"text":"어둑어둑하니","meaning":"昏暗，黑乎乎","explanation":"어둑어둑하다：昏暗，黑乎乎；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"어둑어둑하다","audio":"/audio/500adc91fa6cee39a1be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91864","senseId":"1","lemma":"어둑어둑하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어둑어둑하니","audio":"/audio/56ec2ee9a99cf905ee23.mp3"}},{"text":"밤길","meaning":"夜路","explanation":"밤길：夜路","readings":[{"term":"밤길","audio":"/audio/7e69645285ed900e62c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58001","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밤길","audio":"/audio/7e69645285ed900e62c5.mp3"}},{"text":"조심하렴.","meaning":"小心，谨慎，留心","explanation":"조심하다：小心，谨慎，留心；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"조심하다","audio":"/audio/0ae97bed98d1be70547e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62342","senseId":"1","lemma":"조심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조심하렴","audio":"/audio/a201af51233347b12105.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"818c8a303c20bac0","term":"날","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3","entryId":"62254","definition":"每一天的雨、云、风、气温等的状态。","pronunciation":["날"]},{"id":"500adc91fa6cee39","term":"어둑어둑하다","zh":"昏暗，黑乎乎","audio":"/audio/500adc91fa6cee39a1be.mp3","entryId":"91864","definition":"暗到无法分明看出事物的程度。","pronunciation":["어두거두카다"]},{"id":"7e69645285ed900e","term":"밤길","zh":"夜路","audio":"/audio/7e69645285ed900e62c5.mp3","entryId":"58001","definition":"日落后变暗的路。","pronunciation":["밤낄"]},{"id":"0ae97bed98d1be70","term":"조심하다","zh":"小心，谨慎，留心","audio":"/audio/0ae97bed98d1be70547e.mp3","entryId":"62342","definition":"为避免惹祸而注意言行。","pronunciation":["조ː심하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/60be607d87d267749bc1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.009,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91864","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":143,"sequenceScore":2.8357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["天色渐渐暗下来了，晚上走路要小心点。","最近比较火的行业有哪些呢？","好久没见了，我要和朋友们喝点酒，然后回来。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["天色渐渐暗下来了，晚上走路要小心点。","好久没见了，我要和朋友们喝点酒，然后回来。","最近比较火的行业有哪些呢？"],"answer":0}]}
